cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "figure-tools: waterfall and Sankey figures from plain Python data"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/cminehar-coder/figure-tools"
abstract: >-
  Python tools that turn a list of numbers into publication-style waterfall
  and Sankey figures (PDF, SVG, PNG), with paper and slide styles, plus a
  renderer for interactive material-flow Sankey diagrams with a bibliography.
keywords:
  - sankey
  - waterfall
  - figures
  - matplotlib
  - material flows
authors:
  - family-names: Minehart
    given-names: Cooper
    affiliation: "Carnegie Mellon University"
